<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa March consumer price index up 9.6 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>S.Africa March consumer price index up 9.6 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's all-items consumer price index rose 0.6 percent in March from February after rising 0.5 percent in February, the Central Statistical Service said.</p>
<p>The year-on-year rise was 9.6 percent versus February's 9.8 percent.</p>
<p>A Reuters consensus poll of economists forecast a 0.7 percent month-on-month increase and a 9.7 percent year-on-year rise.</p>
</text>
